Subject: Tweak: skip the intro
Upstream-base: 7a6bf165d9f1c5914181c079c7d4bfa7204f3509

With "Skip intro" enabled the game starts at the main menu, once per launch:

- BootLoadingScene ends its notice screens and the studio logo at once; the
  boot loading continues behind its finished screen.
- The logo's sound bank, which never plays, is unloaded by loading step 13 as
  soon as it has loaded, as the logo's end would unload it. Ending the logo
  while its jingle plays is avoided entirely.
- The intro movie ends as if A were pressed (its own abort check).
- The title screen takes input at once and passes itself with a single press
  of A through its own handler. Back on the title later, it waits for A.

